sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Hermes
    participant M as CentralDark MCP
    participant V as video_frames_extract_local
    participant F as ffmpeg/ffprobe
    participant E as Evidence

    H->>M: tool call(local path, mode)
    M->>V: validate request
    V->>F: probe source
    F-->>V: fps/duration/frames
    V->>F: extract authorized local frames
    F-->>V: images
    V->>E: hashes + manifest
    E-->>M: receipt
    M-->>H: result
